e 0.01s, memory 0.032s. Good. Or use 100 TFLOPS and 500 GB/s. Arithmetic intensity: ops/byte = 1000/16=62.5 ops/byte. Memory can support 500 GB/s *62.5 = 31.2", "top2": [[[1596, -0.0007795749115757644], [760, -7.857503414154053]], [[1144, -1.5020483260741457e-05], [1902, -11.96212387084961]], [[4087, -0.6750173568725586], [310, -0.7666788101196289]], [[1156, -0.03874143585562706], [303, -3.3506901264190674]], [[579, -0.16063044965267181], [25, -2.039576768875122]], [[1622, -0.001386052812449634], [3296, -6.763841152191162]], [[25, -0.4007478356361389], [13, -1.345751404762268]], [[10033, -0.3305269181728363], [79091, -1.8659424781799316]], [[310, -0.006729785818606615], [303, -5.023592472076416]], [[21520, -0.10869082808494568], [1496, -2.280844211578369]], [[1496, -0.004233427345752716], [32308, -5.471024513244629]], [[33541, -0.014498099684715271], [2812, -4.241602420806885]], [[5286, -0.000123150777653791], [261, -9.14818286895752]], [[11, -0.26273059844970703], [303, -1.8976106643676758]], [[883, -0.051477786153554916], [303, -3.5121331214904785]], [[220, -4.291543518775143e-06], [19, -12.989934921264648]], [[19, -2.8849064619862475e-05], [20, -11.075223922729492]], [[15, -1.8239186829305254e-05], [18, -11.369229316711426]], [[15, -9.536747711536009e-07], [16, -14.721332550048828]], [[4105, -2.3841887468734058e-06], [3069, -13.289972305297852]], [[11, -0.0016420845640823245], [13, -6.45799446105957]], [[3069, -5.245222382654902e-06], [33488, -13.507879257202148]], [[21966, -0.48092058300971985], [13775, -1.0217645168304443]], [[6973, -0.6802353262901306], [628, -0.7227214574813843]], [[539, -5.602852525044e-06], [4779, -12.088499069213867]], [[4779, -4.887592695013154e-06], [32288, -12.35659122467041]], [[32288, -1.3113108252582606e-05], [116532, -11.352758407592773]], [[4598, -0.11792278289794922], [524, -2.2356462478637695]], [[1056, -0.001575995935127139], [12204, -6.45927095413208]], [[12204, -0.008587951771914959], [33303, -5.100470542907715]], [[13, -0.381